# MLabs workspace — DEFAULT-DENY (AX-1 · NEXUS:M-109).
# Nothing at this root is tracked unless a `!` line below names it.
# A new file or folder is PRIVATE until this file says otherwise — the safe failure.
# Every child folder (the instance, each project) is its OWN repository and is
# never tracked here. Do not add exceptions for directories that hold private work.
/*

# ── the structural allowlist — the public repo is exactly this ──
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/PHILOSOPHY.md
!/AXIOMS.md
!/METHOD.md
!/skills
!/skills/**
!/tools
!/tools/**

# The tool's view of the skills: a RELATIVE symlink, committed so a fresh clone has
# working skills with nothing to run first. Only the link — everything else the tool
# writes here (settings, local state) stays private by the re-exclusion below.
!/.claude
/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills

# Stage 2+ adds, one line per piece, when the piece exists: templates/, tools/.
